---
description: next-intl + logical CSS + RTL rules
alwaysApply: false
globs: src/**/*.ts, src/**/*.tsx, messages/**
---

- All user-visible strings MUST use next-intl (no hardcoded text in TSX)
- New strings go in `messages/en.json` AND `messages/ar.json` (verified by `pnpm i18n:check`)
- Use logical CSS properties only (`ms/me/ps/pe/start/end`) — never `ml/mr/pl/pr/left/right`
- Set `lang` and `dir` on `<html>` from locale config
- Icons with direction must flip in RTL (`rtl:rotate-180`)
- Date/number formatting via next-intl formatters
- SEO metadata must be localized per locale
- Auth API routes stay at `/api/auth/*` (no locale prefix); redirects include locale (`/en/dashboard`)
